# The Mac's clipboard, under `maryos vm run`: a virtio console port the desktop reads
# (/dev/virtio-ports/org.maryos.clipboard, MaryUI's lp_clipboard_port). The desktop runs as
# DEFAULT_USER, who is in plugdev (hooks/20-user.sh). There is no such port on a Pi.
SUBSYSTEM=="virtio-ports", ATTR{name}=="org.maryos.clipboard", GROUP="plugdev", MODE="0660"
